  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Six card slots in a bag this small feels almost unfair. Our Juliette crossbody is crafted from pebbled leather with a snap closure and just enough interior organization to leave your wallet at home. Errands, evenings, weekends—it handles all the things without making a big deal of it.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> Pebbled leather</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> Lining: 2 way script logo</li>\n<li><strong>Hardware:</strong> Gold hardware (black, driftwood, meringue); silver hardware (light frozen lilac)</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Adjustable crossbody strap with 22&quot; drop</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Interior: 6 credit card slots, slip pocket</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Flap closure with magnetic snap</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 7.76&quot; (L) x 4.52&quot; (H) x 1.08&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
